CALL,BIND,APPLY ?

CALL: Calls a function specific this value passed arguments individually (" calls function with arguments immediatly")

const obj={
  name:"abi",
  display:function (thing){
    console.log(this.name+" "+thing)
  }
}

const obj1={
  name:"Bala"
}

obj.display.call(obj1,"How are you")



APPLY :function specific this value passed argfments individually with arry ("its same call but argumants arrays")

const obj={
  name:"abi",
  display:function (thing){
    console.log(this.name+" "+thing)
  }
}

const obj1={
  name:"Bala"
}

obj.display.apply(obj1,["How are you"])



BIND : its create new function with bound context 

const obj={
  name:"abi",
  display:function (thing){
    console.log(this.name+" "+thing)
  }
}

const obj1={
  name:"Bala"
}

const resultData=obj.display.bind(obj1)

resultData("How are you")